WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
The best way to learn is to practice a little every day.

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:06.500
Listen carefully to the rhythm of the sentence.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:10.000
You don't have to get everything right the first time.

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:14.000
Take a breath, slow down, and try again.

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:18.000
Little by little, your voice will become more confident.
